### Lectura de todos los pedidos
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/manage-orders/Orders

### Lectura de un pedido concreto
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/manage-orders/Orders('client1@client1.com')

### Creación de un pedido
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/manage-orders/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ClientEmail": "client5@client5.com",
    "FirstName": "Lorena",
    "LastName": "García",
    "CreatedOn": "2019-01-01",
    "Reviewed": false,
    "Approved": false
}

### Actualización de un pedido
PUT http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/manage-orders/Orders('client5@client5.com')
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "FirstName": "Lorena (actualizado)",
    "LastName": "García Pérez"
}

### Borrado de un pedido
DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/manage-orders/Orders('client5@client5.com')

### Función vinculada: tasa de impuestos del cliente
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/manage-orders/Orders('client1@client1.com')/ManageOrders.getClientTaxRate(clientEmail='client1@client1.com')

### Acción vinculada: cancelar pedido
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/manage-orders/Orders('client2@client2.com')/ManageOrders.cancelOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientEmail": "client2@client2.com" }
